  <p>
    For more involved situations &mdash; adding or removing a spouse, transferring into a trust, or any
    transfer with potential tax consequences &mdash; consult a real estate attorney in your state before
    signing.
  </p>
  <p>
    Want to save time and skip the research? The{' '}
